      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## LoRA Control on Z-Image Turbo\n\nComfyUI's Z-Image Turbo template with a **LoRA Control** stack between the loaders and the sampler. It runs as is, with no LoRAs, so you can check your models first.\n\n### Use it\n1. **LoRA Stack**: pick up to six LoRAs, each with its own on/off and strength.\n2. **LoRA by Name** (off by default): type part of a file name, e.g. `char-`, and turn it on. It picks one matching LoRA per run, at **random** or in **sequence**.\n3. **LoRA from Folder** (off by default): pick a folder of `models/loras`, turn it on, and it picks one LoRA from it.\n4. **Apply LoRA Stack** loads everything onto the model and text encoder.\n\n**LoRAs used this run** shows exactly what was picked. It's worth keeping when random mode is on.\n\n### Model links\n- **diffusion_models**: [z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors)\n- **text_encoders**: [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors)\n- **vae**: [ae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors)\n\nLoRAs go in `ComfyUI/models/loras`; subfolders show up in **LoRA from Folder**."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## LoRA Control on Z-Image Turbo\n\nComfyUI's Z-Image Turbo template with a **LoRA Control** stack between the loaders and the sampler. It runs as is, with no LoRAs, so you can check your models first.\n\n### Use it\n1. **LoRA Stack**: pick up to six LoRAs, each with its own on/off and strength.\n2. **LoRA by Name** (off by default): type part of a file name, e.g. `char-`, and turn it on. It picks one matching LoRA per run, at **random** or in **sequence**.\n3. **LoRA from Folder** (off by default): pick a folder of `models/loras`, turn it on, and it picks one LoRA from it.\n4. **Apply LoRA Stack** loads everything onto the model and text encoder.\n\n**LoRAs used this run** shows exactly what was picked. It's worth keeping when random mode is on.\n\n### Model links\n- **diffusion_models**: [z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors)\n- **text_encoders**: [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors)\n- **vae**: [ae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors)\n\nLoRAs go in `ComfyUI/models/loras`; subfolders show up in **LoRA from Folder**."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
